he il sottogenere pretenderebbe. Un film per teenager che non è piaciuto ai teenager in America. Noi lo abbiamo ritrovato nei fondi di magazzino di inizio stagione 2001/2002.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"In ogni film dell'orrore c'è sempre un telefono che squilla...","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2000-10-17","status":"Released","rating":4.7,"ratingCount":353,"genres":["Commedia"],"countries":["United States of America"],"facts":{"Runtime":"86m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":19187,"name":"Tiffani Thiessen","role":"Hagitha Utslay","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2L2lENLehoG1OPgxtugS9gG1bdy.jpg"},{"id":74036,"name":"Tom Arnold","role":"Doughy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z2ajL1ozVCS4Ug04zOGCNH06OPP.jpg"},{"id":35549,"name":"Coolio","role":"Principal","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2RXxdCB68Haao2O9Fq8NCRpFkFm.jpg"},{"id":35552,"name":"Majandra Delfino","role":"Martina","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vpUDcYXgKBQBB4hzY6KVPy1AIsk.jpg"},{"id":35551,"name":"Julie Benz","role":"Barbara","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4rLq98jWRAOJIMzGZW0bB5Y6fGX.jpg"},{"id":35550,"name":"Danny Strong","role":"Boner","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/82C6hgzdpHUHizMfedNAP7DSGOj.jpg"},{"id":35548,"name":"Simon Rex","role":"Slab","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/26zpUMZFUHHmPgOnhLFO4KBx1Q7.jpg"},{"id":35547,"name":"Harley Cross","role":"Dawson","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vd8PIxUqUSHWnk0xPt3F5HPGMpo.jpg"},{"id":35545,"name":"Aimee Graham","role":"Screw","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qr9Ju3htBtai2xcekva1lxNMC93.jpg"},{"id":387,"name":"Kim Greist","role":"Mrs. Peacock","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7aXwIzMItarteEgslsBh5mKZHrP.jpg"},{"id":35546,"name":"Chris Palermo","role":"The Killer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ni3d2IaSUk651Yq9HWfoa1Pezya.jpg"},{"id":35554,"name":"Steven A